            </tr>
            <tr>
              <td>“shared <span class="math" set:html={math("\\mathbf{K}=\\mathbf{V}")}></span> <span class="math" set:html={math("\\mathrm{MQA}")}></span> 意味着只有一个 query head。”</td>
              <td><span class="math" set:html={math("\\mathbf{Q}")}></span> heads 仍有 <span class="math" set:html={math("64")}></span> 或 <span class="math" set:html={math("128")}></span> 个；共享的是 <span class="math" set:html={math("\\mathbf{K}")}></span> 与 <span class="math" set:html={math("\\mathbf{V}")}></span>。</td>
              <td>答成 <span class="math" set:html={math("n_h\\gg h_{\\mathrm{kv}}=1")}></span>，多个 query views 读一份 shared key/value memory。</td>
